{"root":"buang","ipa":"/bu.aŋ/","core":"丢弃、扔掉、抛弃，指将不再需要或不想要的东西移除。","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/bu.aŋ/","zh":"丢弃、扔掉、抛弃","phrases":[{"t":"buang air","zh":"排泄、上厕所"},{"t":"buang waktu","zh":"浪费时间"},{"t":"buang muka","zh":"转过脸去（表示不理睬或厌恶）"}],"examples":[{"t":"Tolong buang sampah itu ke tempatnya.","zh":"请把那个垃圾扔到垃圾桶里。"},{"t":"Jangan buang kesempatan emas ini.","zh":"不要浪费这个黄金机会。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"buang","ipa":"/bu.aŋ/","zh":"丢弃","phrase":{"t":"buang sial","zh":"去霉运"},"example":{"t":"Dia membuang barang yang sudah rusak.","zh":"他把坏掉的东西扔了。"}},{"w":"membuang","ipa":"/məm.bu.aŋ/","zh":"扔掉、抛弃（主动语态）","phrase":{"t":"membuang jauh-jauh","zh":"彻底抛弃"},"example":{"t":"Dia membuang semua kenangan pahit itu.","zh":"他抛弃了所有那些痛苦的回忆。"}},{"w":"terbuang","ipa":"/tər.bu.aŋ/","zh":"被扔掉的、被浪费的","phrase":{"t":"waktu terbuang","zh":"被浪费的时间"},"example":{"t":"Banyak makanan terbuang percuma.","zh":"许多食物被白白浪费了。"}},{"w":"pembuangan","ipa":"/pəm.bu.a.ŋan/","zh":"丢弃处、流放、排放","phrase":{"t":"tempat pembuangan sampah","zh":"垃圾填埋场"},"example":{"t":"Dia dijatuhi hukuman pembuangan.","zh":"他被判处流放。"}}],"derSlugs":["buang","membuang","terbuang","pembuangan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-25T09:55:34.457Z","src":"base"}